    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) there is a severe and immediate, or severe and unforeseen, threat to public health; (b) making the declaration is necessary to respond to the threat.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(1) The Director-General may, in writing, make a declaration (a data sharing declaration) under this subsection if the Director-General is satisfied that: (a) there is a severe and immediate, or severe and unforeseen, threat to public health; and (b) making the declaration is necessary to respond to the threat.";
